# Gravity (culture/essays/knowing.md): every escape route is a bound orbit.
# Inputs: people (others are there), ground (you land somewhere).
# Each output is an escape route; it must come back to OR(people, ground): no escape velocity.
INPUT(people)
INPUT(ground)
OUTPUT(heaven)
OUTPUT(leave_town)
OUTPUT(party)
OUTPUT(mirror)
#@ or heaven = people ground
#@ or leave_town = people ground
#@ or party = people ground
#@ or mirror = people ground
heaven = OR(people, ground)
leave_town = OR(heaven, people)
party = OR(leave_town, ground)
mirror = OR(party, heaven)
